r over 25 years, the game now receives the first official update with a significantly improved AI and more than 200 spells at your disposal. Dive back into time, relive this epic adventure and conquer Arcanus and Myrror once and for all!\nMaster of Magic is also available with the Community Update, a free optional patch developed by fans for fans and greatly increasing the polish of Master of Magic with countless fixes.\nFEATURES\n\n• Combination of strategy and RPG elements\n\n• Enduring replayability\n\n• 5 realms of spells and 18 traits to customize your wizard\n\n• 14 races for you to lead\n\n• 198 unique types of units\n\n• 60+ special abilities\n\n• 200+ spells\n\n• 250 editable pre-generated magical items\n\n• Custom item crafting\n\n• Available to play with the optional Community Update","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146370/header.jpg?t=1710928846"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1710928846"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146370/ss_797a4c876c6673dd48bb7f22fddff0caf8904333.600x338.jpg?t=1710928846","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146370/ss_797a4c876c6673dd48bb7f22fddff0caf8904333.1920x1080.jpg?t=1710928846"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146370/ss_01dba3903ccf8ccfcb253e25a4a6a63194948823.600x338.jpg?t=1710928846","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146370/ss_01dba3903ccf8ccfcb253e25a4a6a63194948823.1920x1080.jpg?t=1710928846"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146370/ss_c97d92f5